LangString loreweftResumeInstallationAfterUninstall ${LANG_ENGLISH} "The old version has been removed. This is the returning ${PRODUCTNAME} ${VERSION} installer; continue here to install the new version."
LangString loreweftPreflightLaunchFailed ${LANG_ENGLISH} "The safe upgrade check could not start. New-version files have not been copied, and the old version may already have been removed. Close all Loreweft processes and run this installer again."
LangString loreweftPreflightFailed ${LANG_ENGLISH} "Loreweft could not safely stop its bundled background service. New-version files have not been copied, and the old version may already have been removed. Close Loreweft and its background service, then run this installer again."
LangString loreweftRegistryVersionFailed ${LANG_ENGLISH} "Loreweft files were copied, but Windows could not confirm the installed version. The installation cannot be reported as complete. Close Loreweft and run this installer again; if the problem persists, keep the installer details for support."
